      "id": 37388,
      "name": "McBehrer",
      "username": "McBehrer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-08-28T12:16:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The card itself deals the damage. In this case, it doesn't matter that it doesn't MENTION the source of the damage, as it isn't a target, so there is no way to counter it. You just kind of lose health spontaneously.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This is one of those rule clarifications that isn't really that important.</p>",
