      "id": 37389,
      "name": "Rabit",
      "username": "Rabit",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-08-28T12:45:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Actually, per conversations with Christopher during playtesting, the environment is considered a source of damage - only environment cards lack a reference to the source, and in those cases the environment is the source.</p>\n<p>It would probably be cleaner to consistently reference a source, but the environment cards are short on space and I have a feeling fitting the extra text would be a challenge in some cases.  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=9\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\"></p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:11:13.627Z",
