      "username": "Rabit",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-08-28T23:34:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"ketigid\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> ketigid:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><br><br>As mentioned earlier, Horrid Cacophony is one such villain card.<br><br></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p><br><br>You're absolutely right, ketigid. I believe that's an error - the source should be either HC or The Matriarch, but I have no idea which. I know in <a href=\"http://sentinelsofthemultiverse.com/forum/topic/horrid-cacophony-deals-damage\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">the earlier thread you started</a> (and that <a href=\"http://sentinelsofthemultiverse.com/comment/9566#comment-9566\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">you linked to, above</a>) we never received an official answer, but until we do I recommend we individually make an assumption and play.&nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/sunglasses.png?v=12\" title=\":sunglasses:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sunglasses:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">  I like the argument that the source is \"this card\" (HC), personally, so that's probably what I'll go with when I play.</p>\n<p>At least until we get some errata on it.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=12\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
